+;WHAT RETIRED WITH THE FRAME PATH, AND WHAT IT BOUGHT (docs/o1-rom-2.0.md 4.7,
+;4.9).  GONE: PRESENT(1), PRESENT(2) AND PRESENT(0); THE FRAME'S TWO TRAILER
