+;TEXT WHERE THE VENDOR'S 182-BYTE SIGN-ON MESSAGE SAT.  THE SLOT KEEPS ITS
+;LENGTH, BECAUSE EVERYTHING BELOW 0F67H IS ANCHORED BY THE CBIOS'S ABSOLUTE
