+;THE FILL IS NOT DECORATION AND NOT OPTIONAL: 24 OF THE ATTRIBUTE ARRAY'S 4096
+;CELLS READ 7FH (DIM) AT THE SIGN-ON, SO A SCREEN THAT IS NOT FILLED BRIGHT
